Expression	                      Meaning
${{ github.actor }}	     Username of the person who triggered the workflow
${{ github.repository }}     Repository name (owner/repo)
${{ github.ref }}	     Full Git reference (for example, refs/heads/main)
${{ github.ref_name }}	     Short branch or tag name (for example, main)
${{ github.sha }}	     Commit SHA
${{ github.workflow }}	     Workflow name
${{ github.event_name }}     Triggering event (push, pull_request, etc.)
${{ github.run_number }}     Workflow run number
